# Object Property: obo:RO_0003000 (produces)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:RO_0003000 "a produces b if some process that occurs_in a has_output b, where a and b are material entities. Examples: hybridoma cell line produces monoclonal antibody reagent; chondroblast produces avascular GAG-rich matrix.")
