AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:RO_0003000 "produces")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:RO_0003000 "Note that this definition doesn't quite distinguish the output of a transformation process from a production process, which is related to the identity/granularity issue.")
