# Class: obo:HP_0002099 (Asthma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HP_0002099 "Asthma is characterized by increased responsiveness of the tracheobronchial tree to multiple stimuli, leading to narrowing of the air passages with resultant dyspnea, cough, and wheezing.")
