# Class: obo:HP_0100022 (Abnormality of movement)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:HP_0100022 "An abnormality of movement with a neurological basis characterized by changes in coordination and speed of voluntary movements.")
