# Class: obo:MONDO_0000863 (myopathy, lactic acidosis, and sideroblastic anemia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:2598") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0000863 "Mitochondrial myopathy and sideroblastic anemia belongs to the heterogeneous family of metabolic myopathies. It is characterized by progressive exercise intolerance manifesting in childhood, onset of sideroblastic anemia around adolescence, lactic acidaemia, and mitochondrial myopathy.")
