# Class: obo:MONDO_0002565 (myelitis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:P378") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0002565 "An inflammatory process affecting the spinal cord. Causes include viral infections, autoimmune disorders, vascular disorders, and toxic agents. Symptoms include weakness, paresthesia, sensory loss, pain, and incontinence.")
