AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "MESH:D014973") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0002615 "A condition marked by the development of widespread xanthomas, yellow tumor-like structures filled with lipid deposits. Xanthomas can be found in a variety of tissues including the skin; tendons; joints of knees and elbows. Xanthomatosis is associated with disturbance of lipid metabolism and formation of foam cells.")
