# Class: obo:MONDO_0004513 (adult pleomorphic rhabdomyosarcoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C27369") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0004513 "An aggressive rhabdomyosarcoma occurring in adults. The neoplasm is characterized by the presence of bizarre round, spindle, and polygonal cells. Clinical presentation includes a rapidly enlarging painful mass usually in the lower extremities.")
