# Class: obo:MONDO_0005206 (renal carcinoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C9384") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0005206 "A carcinoma arising from the epithelium of the renal parenchyma or the renal pelvis. The majority are renal cell carcinomas. Kidney carcinomas usually affect middle aged and elderly adults. Hematuria, abdominal pain, and a palpable mass are common symptoms.")
