# Class: obo:MONDO_0005477 (ventricular tachycardia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:P378") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0005477 "A disorder characterized by an electrocardiographic finding of three or more consecutive complexes of ventricular origin with a rate greater than a certain threshold (100 or 120 beats per minute are commonly used). The QRS complexes are wide and have an abnormal morphology. (CDISC)")
