# Class: obo:MONDO_0005579 (idiopathic generalized epilepsy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "OMIM:600669") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.epilepsydiagnosis.org/epilepsy/generalized-epilepsy-groupoverview.html") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0005579 "A generalised epilepsy that encompasses several common seizure phenotypes including childhood absence epilepsy, juvenile absence epilepsy, juvenile myoclonic epilepsy and epilepsy with generalized tonic-clonic seizures alone. These epilepsy syndromes have polygenic inheritance with or without environmental factors contributing to seizure susceptibility. Seizure types include one or a combination of absence seizures, myoclonic seizures and/or generalized tonic-clonic seizures.")
