# Class: obo:MONDO_0006505 (basal ganglia cerebrovascular disorder)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "MESH:D020144") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0006505 "A pathological condition caused by impaired blood flow in the basal regions of cerebral hemispheres (basal ganglia), such as infarction; hemorrhage; or ischemia in vessels of this brain region including the lateral lenticulostriate arteries. Primary clinical manifestations include involuntary movements (dyskinesias) and muscle weakness (hemiparesis).")
