# Class: obo:MONDO_0007407 (Cryoglobulinemic vasculitis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:91138") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0007407 "Mixed cryoglobulinemia (MC) is a rare multisystem disease characterized by the presence of circulating cryoprecipitable immune complexes in the serum, manifested clinically by a classical triad of purpura, weakness and arthralgia.")
