AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:90026") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0007571 "Primary erythermalgia is characterized by intermittent attacks of red, warm, painful burning extremities. It spontaneously arises during early childhood and adolescence in the absence of any detectable underlying disorder.")
