# Class: obo:MONDO_0008045 (spinal muscular atrophy-progressive myoclonic epilepsy syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:2590") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008045 "Spinal muscular atrophy-progressive myoclonic epilepsy syndrome is characterized by hereditary myoclonus and progressive distal muscular atrophy. Less than 10 cases have been reported. Treatment with clonazepam results in complete and lasting improvement of the myoclonus.")
