# Class: obo:MONDO_0008050 (MYH7-related skeletal myopathy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:59135") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008050 "A rare autosomal dominant distal myopathy characterized by preferential weakness of the great toe, ankle dorsiflexor, finger extensor and neck flexor. Progression is slow with variations in age of onset, severity, weakness, cardiac, and respiratory involvement.")
