AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:273") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008056 "Steinert disease, also known as myotonic dystrophy type 1, is a muscle disease characterized by myotonia and by multiorgan damage that combines various degrees of muscle weakness, arrhythmia and/or cardiac conduction disorders, cataract, endocrine damage, sleep disorders and baldness.")
