# Class: obo:MONDO_0008222 (Andersen-Tawil syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:37553") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008222 "Andersen's syndrome (AS) is a rare disorder characterized by periodic muscle paralysis, prolongation of the QT interval with a variety of ventricular arrhythmias (leading to predisposition to sudden cardiac death) and characteristic physical features: short stature, scoliosis, low-set ears, hypertelorism, broad nasal root, micrognathia, clinodactyly, brachydactyly and syndactyly.")
