# Class: obo:MONDO_0008383 (rheumatoid arthritis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C2884") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008383 "A chronic, systemic autoimmune disorder characterized by inflammation in the synovial membranes and articular surfaces. It manifests primarily as a symmetric, erosive polyarthritis that spares the axial skeleton and is typically associated with the presence in the serum of rheumatoid factor.")
