# Class: obo:MONDO_0008722 (short chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenase deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:26792") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008722 "Short-chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenase (SCAD) deficiency is a very rare inborn error of mitochondrial fatty acid oxidation characterized by variable manifestations ranging from asymptomatic individuals (in most cases) to those with failure to thrive, hypotonia, seizures, developmental delay and progressive myopathy.")
