# Class: obo:MONDO_0008783 (Tangier disease)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:31150") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008783 "Tangier disease (TD) is a rare lipoprotein metabolism disorder characterized biochemically by an almost complete absence of plasma high-density lipoproteins (HDL), and clinically by liver, spleen, lymph node and tonsil enlargement along with peripheral neuropathy in children and adolescents, and, occasionally, cardiovascular disease in adults.")
