# Class: obo:MONDO_0008948 (cerebrotendinous xanthomatosis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:909") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008948 "Cerebrotendinous xanthomatosis (CTX) is an anomaly of bile acid synthesis characterized by neonatal cholestasis, childhood-onset cataract, adolescent to young adult-onset tendon xanthomata, and brain xanthomata with adult-onset neurologic dysfunction.")
