# Class: obo:MONDO_0008963 (Chediak-Higashi syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:167") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0008963 "ChC)diak-Higashi syndrome (CHS) is a rare severe genetic disorder generally characterized by partial oculocutaneous albinism (OCA), severe immunodeficiency, mild bleeding, neurological dysfunction and lymphoproliferative disorder. A classic, early-onset form and an attenuated, later-onset form (Atypical CHS) have been described.")
