# Class: obo:MONDO_0009529 (pyruvate dehydrogenase E3 deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:2394") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0009529 "Pyruvate dehydrogenase E3 deficiency is a very rare subtype of pyruvate dehydrogenase deficiency (PDHD) characterized by either early-onset lactic acidosis and delayed development, later-onset neurological dysfunction or liver disease.")
