# Class: obo:MONDO_0009693 (plasma cell myeloma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C3242") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0009693 "A bone marrow-based plasma cell neoplasm characterized by a serum monoclonal protein and skeletal destruction with osteolytic lesions, pathological fractures, bone pain, hypercalcemia, and anemia. Clinical variants include non-secretory myeloma, smoldering myeloma, indolent myeloma, and plasma cell leukemia. (WHO, 2001)")
