# Class: obo:MONDO_0009897 (adult polyglucosan body disease)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:206583") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0009897 "Adult polyglucosan body disease (APBD) is a glycogen storage disease of adults characterized by progressive upper and lower motor neuron dysfunction, progressive neurogenic bladder and cognitive difficulties that can lead to dementia.")
