# Class: obo:MONDO_0009958 (adult Refsum disease)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:773") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0009958 "A very rare, clinically variable, multisystemic metabolic disease, characterized by anosmia, early-onset retinitis pigmentosa and possible neurological manifestations, including neuropathy, and cerebellar ataxia, deafness, ichthyosis, skeletal abnormalities, and cardiac arrhythmia. It is characterized biochemically by accumulation of phytanic acid in plasma and tissues.")
