# Class: obo:MONDO_0010188 (familial isolated deficiency of vitamin E)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:96") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0010188 "Ataxia with vitamin E deficiency (AVED) is a neurodegenerative disease belonging to the inherited cerebellar ataxias. It is mainly characterized by progressive spino-cerebellar ataxia, loss of proprioception, areflexia, and is associated with a marked deficiency in vitamin E.")
