# Class: obo:MONDO_0010258 (MEHMO syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:85282") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0010258 "MEHMO syndrome is characterized by severe intellectual deficit, epilepsy, microcephaly, hypogenitalism, and obesity. Growth delay and diabetes are also present. To date, it has been described in seven boys, all of whom died within the first two years of life. The causative gene has been localized to the 21.1-22.13p region of the X chromosome and the syndrome appears to result from mitochondrial dysfunction.")
