# Class: obo:MONDO_0010271 (X-linked myotubular myopathy-abnormal genitalia syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:456328") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0010271 "X-linked myotubular myopathy-abnormal genitalia syndrome is a rare chromosomal anomaly, partial deletion of the long arm of chromosome X, characterized by a combination of clinical manifestations of X-linked myotubular myopathy and a 46,XY disorder of sex development. Patients present with severe form of congenital myopathy and abnormal male genitalia.")
