# Class: obo:MONDO_0010549 (Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease X-linked dominant 1)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C129068") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0010549 "Charcot-Marie-Tooth neuropathy that is inherited in an X-linked manner, and is associated with mutation(s) in the GJB1 gene, encoding gap junction beta-1 protein. The condition is characterized by moderate to severe motor and sensory neuropathy in males, and mild to no symptoms in females.")
