# Class: obo:MONDO_0010787 (Kearns-Sayre syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:480") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0010787 "Kearns-Sayre syndrome (KSS) is a mitochondrial disease characterized by progressive external ophthalmoplegia (PEO), pigmentary retinitis and an onset before the age of 20 years. Common additional features include deafness, cerebellar ataxia and heart block.")
