AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C2938") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011057 "A disorder resulting from inadequate blood flow in the vessels that supply the brain. Representative examples include cerebrovascular ischemia, cerebral embolism, and cerebral infarction.")
