# Class: obo:MONDO_0011128 (Sheldon-hall syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:1147") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011128 "Sheldon-Hall syndrome (SHS) is a rare multiple congenital contracture syndrome characterized by contractures of the distal joints of the limbs, triangular face, downslanting palpebral fissures, small mouth, and high arched palate.")
