# Class: obo:MONDO_0011466 (distal myopathy, Welander type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:603") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011466 "Welander distal myopathy (WDM) is a distal myopathy, characterized by weakness in the distal upper extremities, usually finger and wrist extensors which later progresses to all hand muscles and distal lower extremity, primarily in toe and ankle extensors.")
