# Class: obo:MONDO_0011577 (myopathy, proximal, and ophthalmoplegia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "OMIM:605637") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011577 "Any congenital myopathy in which the cause of the disease is a mutation in MYH2 gene. The disorder is either slowly progressive or nonprogressive, and affected individuals retain ambulation, although there is variable severity. It can show both autosomal dominant and autosomal recessive inheritance.")
