# Class: obo:MONDO_0011889 (Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2I)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:99942") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011889 "Autosomal dominant Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2I (CMT2I) is a form of axonal Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease, a peripheral sensorimotor neuropathy, characterized by a late onset with severe sensory loss (paresthesia and hypoesthesia) associated with distal weakness, mainly of the legs, and absent or reduced deep tendon reflexes.")
