# Class: obo:MONDO_0011903 (Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2J)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:99943") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0011903 "Autosomal dominant Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2J (CMT2J) is a form of axonal Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease, a peripheral sensorimotor neuropathy, characterized by a relatively late onset, pupillary abnormalities and deafness, in most patients, associated with distal weakness and muscle atrophy.")
