# Class: obo:MONDO_0012172 (mitochondrial trifunctional protein deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:746") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0012172 "Mitochondrial trifunctional protein (TFP) deficiency (TFPD) is a disorder of fatty acid oxidation characterized by a wide clinical spectrum ranging from severe neonatal manifestations including cardiomyopathy, hypoglycemia, metabolic acidosis, skeletal myopathy and neuropathy, liver disease and death to a mild phenotype with peripheral polyneuropathy, episodic rhabdomyolysis and pigmentary retinopathy..")
