# Class: obo:MONDO_0012198 (PCWH syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:163746") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0012198 "A syndrome characterized by the association of the features of Waardenburg-Shah syndrome (WSS) (sensorineural hearing loss, pigmentary abnormalities and Hirschsprung disease) with neurological features, namely, neonatal hypotonia, intellectual deficit (of variable severity), nystagmus, progressive spasticity, ataxia and epilepsy.")
