# Class: obo:MONDO_0012450 (spinocerebellar ataxia type 28)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:101109") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0012450 "Spinocerebellar ataxia type 28 (SCA28) is a very rare subtype of type I autosomal dominant cerebellar ataxia (ADCA type I). It is characterized by juvenile onset, slowly progressive cerebellar ataxia due to Purkinje cell degeneration.")
