# Class: obo:MONDO_0012512 (fatal mitochondrial disease due to combined oxidative phosphorylation defect type 3)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:168566") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0012512 "Combined oxidative phosphorylation deficiency type 3 is an extremely rare clinically heterogenous disorder described in about 5 patients to date. Clinical signs included hypotonia, lactic acidosis, and hepatic insufficiency, with progressive encephalomyopathy or hypertrophic cardiomyopathy.")
