# Class: obo:MONDO_0012683 (pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 6)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:166073") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0012683 "Pontocerebellar hypoplasia type 6 (PCH6) is a rare form of pontocerebellar hypoplasia characterized clinically at birth by hypotonia, clonus, epilepsy impaired swallowing and from infancy by progressive microencephaly, spasticity and lactic acidosis.")
