# Class: obo:MONDO_0013212 (Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease axonal type 2N)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:228174") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0013212 "Autosomal dominant Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2N (CMT2N) is a mild form of axonal Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease, a peripheral sensorimotor neuropathy, characterized by distal legs sensory loss and weakness that can be asymmetric. Tendon reflexes are reduced in the knees and absent in ankles. Progression is slow.")
