# Class: obo:MONDO_0013731 (MEGF10-related myopathy)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:22371254") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:27460346") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0013731 "A congenital myopathy caused by mutations in the multiple epidermal growth factor-like domains 10 (MEGF10) gene, which causes early-onset myopathy characterized by severe weakness, scoliosis, joint contractures, areflexia, respiratory distress, and dysphagia, and a milder phenotype of minicore myopathy.")
