AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:314637") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0013865 "A rare mitochondrial oxidative phosphorylation disorder with complex I and IV deficiency characterized by lactic acidosis, hypotonia, hypertrophic cardiomyopathy and global developmental delay. Other clinical features include feeding difficulties, failure to thrive, seizures, optic atrophy and ataxia.")
