# Class: obo:MONDO_0014162 (infantile hypertrophic cardiomyopathy due to MRPL44 deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:352563") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0014162 "Infantile hypertrophic cardiomyopathy due to MRPL44 deficiency is a rare mitochondrial oxidative phosphorylation disorder with complex I and IV deficiency characterized by hypertrophic cardiomyopathy, hepatic steatosis with elevated liver transaminases, exercise intolerance and muscle weakness. Neuro-opthalmological features (hemiplegic migraine, Leigh-like lesions on brain MRI, pigmentary retinopathy) have been reported later in life.")
