# Class: obo:MONDO_0014784 (severe hypotonia-psychomotor developmental delay-strabismus-cardiac septal defect syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:467176") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0014784 "Severe hypotonia-psychomotor developmental delay-strabismus-cardiac septal defect syndrome is a rare, genetic, non-dystrophic congenital myopathy disorder characterized by a neonatal-onset of severe generalized hypotonia associated with mild psychomotor delay, congenital strabismus with abducens nerve palsy, and atrial and/or ventricular septal defects. Cryptorchidism is commonly reported in male patients and muscle biopsy typically reveals increased variability in muscle fiber size.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:GARD") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0014784 "GARD:0017840")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:MEDGEN") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:equivalentTo") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0014784 "MEDGEN:902080")
