# Class: obo:MONDO_0015355 (distal hereditary motor neuropathy type 7)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:139589") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0015355 "Distal hereditary motor neuropathy type 7 is a rare, slowly progressive genetic peripheral neuropathy characterized by distal atrophy and weakness affecting the upper limbs (with a predilection for the thenar eminence) and subsequently the lower limbs, associated with uni- or bilateral vocal cord paresis leading to hoarse voice and breathing difficulties, and facial weakness.")
