# Class: obo:MONDO_0016825 (mitochondrial myopathy-lactic acidosis-deafness syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:2597") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0016825 "Mitochondrial myopathy-lactic acidosis-deafness is a type of metabolic myopathy described only in two sisters to date, presenting during childhood, and characterized clinically by growth failure, severe muscle weakness, and moderate sensorineural deafness and biochemically by metabolic acidosis, elevated serum pyruvate concentration, hyperalaninemia and hyperalaninuria. There have been no further descriptions in the literature since 1973.")
