AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:263") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0016971 "Limb-girdle muscular dystrophy (LGMD) is a heterogeneous group of muscular dystrophies characterized by proximal weakness affecting the pelvic and shoulder girdles. Cardiac and respiratory impairment may be observed in certain forms of LGMD.")
