# Class: obo:MONDO_0017343 (Epstein-Barr virus-associated lymphoproliferative disorder)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:38882456") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0017343 "A range of lymphoproliferative diseases characterized by uncontrolled proliferation of B cells, T cells, or NK cells infected with Epstein-Barr virus. Depending on host immunity and viral factors, viral persistence in host cells can induce lymphoproliferation with a diverse clinical spectrum ranging from simple reactive hyperplasia to aggressive lymphoma/leukemia with unique clinical and pathological presentations.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:GARD") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0017343 "GARD:0021147")
