# Class: obo:MONDO_0017569 (de Barsy syndrome)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:2962") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0017569 "A rare autosomal recessive genetic disorder characterized by facial dysmorphism (down-slanting palpebral fissures, a broad flat nasal bridge and a small mouth) with a progeroid appearance, large and late-closing fontanel, cutis laxa (CL), joint hyperlaxity, athetoid movements and hyperreflexia, pre- and postnatal growth retardation, intellectual deficit and developmental delay, and corneal clouding and cataract.")
