# Class: obo:MONDO_0017720 (GM2 gangliosidosis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:309152") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0017720 "A group of recessively inherited diseases characterized by the intralysosomal accumulation of G(M2) GANGLIOSIDE in the neuronal cells. Subtypes include mutations of enzymes in the BETA-N-ACETYLHEXOSAMINIDASES system or G(M2) ACTIVATOR PROTEIN leading to disruption of normal degradation of GANGLIOSIDES, a subclass of ACIDIC GLYCOSPHINGOLIPIDS.")
