# Class: obo:MONDO_0017816 (primary systemic amyloidosis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:314701") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0017816 "Primary systemic amyloidosis (PSA) is a form of AL amyloidosis caused by the aggregation and deposition of insoluble amyloid fibrils derived from misfolded monoclonal immunoglobulin light chains usually produced by a plasma cell tumor and characterized by multiple organ involvement.")
