AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MEDGEN:1633598") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:MEDGEN") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:equivalentTo") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0017940 "UMLS:C4707173")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:324611") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:MONDO_0017940 "CMT2 due to KIF5A mutation")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:id obo:MONDO_0017940 "MONDO:0017940")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:MONDO_0017940 "autosomal dominant Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease type 2 due to KIF5A mutation")
