# Class: obo:MONDO_0018596 (systemic polyarteritis nodosa)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:439762") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0018596 "Systemic polyarteritis nodosa (PAN) is a chronic systemic necrotizingvasculitis of adults and childrenaffecting small- and medium-sized vessels and characterized by formation of microaneurysms leading to serious generalized disease and multi-organ involvement.")
