# Class: obo:MONDO_0019403 (congenital dyserythropoietic anemia)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:85") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0019403 "Congenital dyserythropoietic anemia (CDA) is a heterogenous group of hematological disorders of late erythropoiesis and red cell abnormalities that lead to anemia. Five types of CDA are defined: CDA I, CDA II, CDA III, CDA IV and thrombocytopenia with CDA.")
