# Class: obo:MONDO_0019438 (AL amyloidosis)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:85443") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0019438 "AL Amyloidosis is a plasma cell disorder characterized by the aggregation and deposition of insoluble amyloid fibrils derived from misfolding of monoclonal immunoglobulin light chains usually produced by a plasma cell tumor. It usually presents as primary systemic amyloidosis (PSA) with multiple organ involvement and less frequently as primary localized amyloidosis (PLA) restricted to a single organ.")
