# Class: obo:MONDO_0019549 (severe early-onset axonal neuropathy due to MFN2 deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Orphanet:90118") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0019549 "A rare axonal hereditary motor and sensory neuropathy characterized by early onset (<10 years) progressive distal muscle weakness and wasting of the lower limbs and later, to a lesser extent the upper limbs resulting in foot and wrist drop, areflexia, skeletal deformities (kyphoscoliosis, pes cavus with flattening, joint contractures), mild sensory impairment with vibration sense reduced to a greater extent than pain, optic atrophy and hearing loss. Wheelchair dependence by adolescence is usual and respiratory impairment with diaphragmatic paralysis may develop.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:GARD") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0019549 "GARD:0019123")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:MEDGEN") Annotation(oboInOwl:source "MONDO:equivalentTo") oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:MONDO_0019549 "MEDGEN:1641956")
