# Class: obo:MONDO_0020531 (long chain acyl-CoA dehydrogenase deficiency)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C84537") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0020531 "A genetic disorder characterized by deficiency of the enzyme long-chain acyl-coenzyme A dehydrogenase that metabolizes long-chain fatty acids. Signs and symptoms appear in infancy or childhood and may be triggered during fasting, illness or exercise. They include hypoglycemia, muscle weakness and lethargy.")
