# Class: obo:MONDO_0020944 (fungal infection of eye)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "MESH:D015821") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0020944 "Infection by a variety of fungi, usually through four possible mechanisms: superficial infection producing conjunctivitis, keratitis, or lacrimal obstruction; extension of infection from neighboring structures - skin, paranasal sinuses, nasopharynx; direct introduction during surgery or accidental penetrating trauma; or via the blood or lymphatic routes in patients with underlying mycoses.")
