# Class: obo:MONDO_0023644 (lip and oral cavity carcinoma)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:C9315") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0023644 "A carcinoma arising in the lip or oral cavity. Most oral cavity carcinomas are squamous cell carcinomas of the tongue, buccal mucosa, or gums. Less frequent morphologic variants include mucoepidermoid carcinoma and adenocarcinoma. Lip carcinomas are usually basal cell or squamous cell carcinomas.")
