# Class: obo:MONDO_0033885 (mitochondrial complex IV deficiency, nuclear-type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "NCIT:P378") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0033885 "A very rare inherited metabolic disorder characterized by deficiency of the enzyme cytochrome-C oxidase. It may be manifested as an isolated myopathy or a systemic disorder. Signs and symptoms include myotonia, dysfunction of the heart, kidney, and brain, and lactic acidosis.")
