AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:MONDO_0100524 "The diagnosis of an ASAH1-related disorder is established in a proband with suggestive clinical findings by identification of biallelic pathogenic variants in ASAH1 and/or decreased activity of the enzyme acid ceramidase in peripheral blood leukocytes or cultured skin fibroblasts. [https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40060/, PMID:29595935]")
