# Class: obo:MONDO_0700372 (AFG3L2-related optic atrophy and/or spastic ataxia spectrum)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:32219868") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://clinicalgenome.org/affiliation/40077") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_0700372 "Any disorder caused by a heterozygous variant or biallelic variants in the AFG3L2 gene and characterized by a spectrum of phenotypes including optic atrophy and/or spastic ataxia.")
