# Class: obo:MONDO_1060109 (PLEC-related muscular dystrophy-epidermolysis bullosa simplex spectrum disorder)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "PMID:35815343") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:MONDO_1060109 "A spectrum of disease associated with loss or disrupted function of the PLEC gene. These disorders primarily affect the skin and muscles, leading to a range of symptoms including skin blistering (EBS), progressive muscle weakness (muscular dystrophy), and other complications.")
