# Class: obo:NCIT_C123663 (12-Item Multiple Sclerosis Walking Scale Questionnaire)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:NCIT_P378 "NCI") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C123663 "A standardized rating scale developed by Hobart et al in 2003, which is used to measure the impact of multiple sclerosis (MS) on an individual's walking ability. The questionnaire contains 12 items on a scale from 1 (not at all) to 5 (extremely).")
