AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:NCIT_P378 "NCI") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C141686 "A timed function test, one of a series of exercise testing modalities that were initially introduced in the 1960s, that assesses functional mobility by measuring walking or running speed in meters per second over ten meters.")
