AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:NCIT_P378 "NCI") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C141689 "A timed function test, one of a series of exercise testing modalities that were initially introduced in the 1960s, that measures functional mobility by assessing the time taken and techniques used to climb four standard-size stairs.")
