# Class: obo:NCIT_C202084 (Eating Assessment Tool-10)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:NCIT_P378 "NCI") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C202084 "A ten question measure designed to assess swallowing difficulties.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100007") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C202084 "An assessment that uses the Dysphagimeter scale to assess dysphagia or swallowing impairements. The Dysphagimeter is a patient-reported questionnaire that measures the ability to swallow foods of different textures and the impact of dysphagia on activities and participation. This questionnaire has three parts. Part A includes 24 items concerning solid foods, Part B includes 3 items on liquids and Part C includes 8 items, namely 6 items on the impact of dysphagia at meal times and 2 items on discomfort related to thick saliva. Each item offers 5 choices of descriptive answers. Parts A and B also include an option 'I cannot answer'. The participant must carefully read the instructions and check the answer that best corresponds to their situation for each item.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100010") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C202084 "Assessment of the strengh of the tongue muscle by using Iowa Oral Performance Instrument.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100013") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C202084 "The Sydney swallowing questionnaire is a self-reported questionnaire that aims to assess the severity of swallowing problems. It contains 17 questions. The participant answers questions 1 to 11 and 13 to 17 by drawing an X on a line (analogue visual scale questions) and question 12 by checking the answer of their choice among 6 options. A validated French-Canadian version has been created.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:source "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100014") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C202084 "The goal of the 80 ml water swallowing test is to swallow the quickliest possible water without choking.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:NCIT_C202084 "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100007")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:NCIT_C202084 "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100010")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:NCIT_C202084 "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100013")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:NCIT_C202084 "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PROMOT_0100014")
