# Class: obo:UBERON_0000108 (blastula stage)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "Wikipedia:Blastula") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:UBERON_0000108 "An early stage of embryonic development in animals. It is produced by cleavage of a fertilized ovum and consists of a spherical layer of around 128 cells surrounding a central fluid-filled cavity called the blastocoel. The blastula follows the morula and precedes the gastrula in the developmental sequence.")
