AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "MP:0012510") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:UBERON_0005432 "The dilated structure that is lined by endothelial cells and located at the arterial pole of the heart just above (distal to) the truncus arteriosus in mammalian embryos; it is the primordial vascular channel from which the aortic arches (and eventually the dorsal aortae) arise; the aortic sac is homologous to the ventral aorta of gill-bearing vertebrates.")
