SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/132> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/130>)

# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> (Zinc fingers CXXC-type)

AnnotationAssertion(terms:description <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> "This domain contains eight conserved cysteine residues that bind to two zinc ions. The CXXC domain is found in a variety of chromatin-associated proteins. This domain binds to non-methylated CpG dinucleotides. The domain is characterised by two CGXCXXC repeats. The RecQ helicase has a single repeat that also binds to zinc, but this has not been included in this family. The DNA binding interface has been identified by NMR.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> "CXXC")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> "zf-CXXC")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> "Zinc fingers CXXC-type")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/136> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/26>)

