AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "G protein subunits beta")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431>)

