# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> (GTPases)

AnnotationAssertion(terms:description <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "The group represents genes encoding enzymes of the class 3.6.5.-, hydrolases that act of GTP.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "GTPases")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "GTPases")
