AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/437> "Glycogen phosphorylases")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/437> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/424>)

